Description: Dataset on multilateral development bank (MDB) investment in water 
    supply and sanitation between 1960 and 2020 compiled by drawing on 3,639
    water and sanitation projects to assess territorial trends, technology 
    choices, distribution of financial burdens, and reforms to institutional 
    arrangements.
